window.products.push({"id":709107,"name":"Hinyo 28 Pcs Large Silk Hydrangea Flowers Artificial Flowers 8 inch Hydrangea Head with stem,Used for Home Wedding Party Decoration (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HiHpuRFtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color: White 28 PCS Artificial Silk Hydrangea Heads Size:Hydrangea Heads diameter:8inch/20cm;stem length:10inch/26cm.  Material:silk fabrics+ plastic;  Packing: 28 pcs hydrangea flower heads.and with Stems  Q&A  Why choose artificial flowers?  Silk fake flowers not only have the beautiful appearance of flowers,but also last longer life time than fresh flowers. They stay as beautiful as the day you get them. If you use fresh flowers on a big party or wedding will be very expensive, but use artificial flowers will save a lot. Artificial flower characteristics 1. The flower color is gorgeous, the shape is chic, dignified and elegant, the preservation time is long, and the four seasons are in full bloom like spring.  2. The cost is much lower than that of flowers;  3. At the same time as craft lovers get leisure and entertainment, they also get a favorite gift and beautiful enjoyment; Customer Need Knows： How to use flower stems? Use the thick end of the flower stem to accompany the hole in the flower head.(Not the narrow end) How to care of flowers? The flower will be squashed during transportation. Try to blow the flower with a hair dryer, or let it stand for several hours, and adjust the flower branch by hand, so that the flower will be more vivid.. What made of? Made of silk cloth,plastic stem with wire.The stem of artificial flowers can be adjusted its length according to requirements: Bent and pruned for shorter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HiHpuRFtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hinyo","source_asin":"B0979CGBF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0979CGBF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0979CGBF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
