window.products.push({"id":709136,"name":"IKAPE Espresso Tamper Distributor Base, Coffee Tamper Base Compatible with All Brand Espresso Calibrated Tamper Size, Espresso Distributor Base Especi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OMN7xScbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖 Overall size ☕: 2.36*2.95*0.43 INCH( 60*75*11 MM ), weighs about 0.18 lbs. 💖Tamper & Distributor Storage Terminator ☕. Do you often worry about the space storage of your coffee bar? Now, IKAPE designers have designed a tamper base specifically for storing your espresso tamper and distributor. The flying saucer shape is sci-fi in appearance, fulfilling our planet-traveling dreams; the small and compact body can optimize your storage space to the maximum. Imagine having your espresso distributor & espresso tamper neatly lined up. Wow Wow!! What an incredible scene. 💖Premium Aluminum Body ☕: Be made of pure aluminum alloy material, IKAPE'S distributor base is drop-proof and durable with a thick texture. The rounded shape of the base prevents slippage and wear and tear, better protecting your tamper and distributor. And yes, it does look better and takes up less of your bar area. 💖Super Compatible Tamper Base ☕: This tamper base not only works with IKAPE brand coffee tamper and distributor but also adapts to all other brands of calibrated tampers and coffee distributors on the market, including all Breville and other brands of accessories. It is an essential espresso accessory. 💖Our philosophy ☕: IKAPE is a brand created by a group of espresso-loving baristas who are committed to providing quality accessories and tools to get the best espresso coffee. We also want to convey our philosophy of making fine coffee to more consumers. In addition, we offer a one-year after-sales service. When you are unsatisfied with your purchase, you can contact us at any time, and we will refund 100% of the money, or you can donate to a group in need and pass on your good deed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OMN7xScbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKAPE","source_asin":"B0BJKJ2L1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJKJ2L1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJKJ2L1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
