window.products.push({"id":709255,"name":"Toscana Hand Painted Bees Wall Clock From Italy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":202.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q-x44GISL._AC_SL1260_.jpg","description":"As the name infers, the pieces in this collection are all produced in beautiful, sun-drenched Tuscany. This region of Italy has been famous throughout the world since the 14th century for its production of exquisite, handmade pottery. Prominent in Tuscan ceramics and our \"Toscana? collection are the rich blues, yellows and greens of the Renaissance. Brighten your garden or patio with our Bacchus mask or for a touch of the sacred, try our Della Robbia Madonna and Child. Our \"Toscana Bees\" Collection features fruit on a warm yellow background, alive with bees. Use these serving pieces for cozy dinners at home or decorate your kitchen with them for a touch of whimsy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q-x44GISL._AC_SL1260_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toscana Bees Collection","source_asin":"B005GLQWPU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GLQWPU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GLQWPU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
