window.products.push({"id":709292,"name":"LuxKitchen Stainless Steel Rocking Garlic Press - Easy Press Garlic Masher – Multifunctional Use, Garlic Crusher, Mincer – Easy Peel Garlic Peeler Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vq6kGdtyL._AC_SL1078_.jpg","description":"It’s no surprise so many food recipes ask for garlic. Garlic is a flavor powerhouse, and it reliably adds a delicious aroma and a depth of intense flavor to whatever you’re cooking. However, it can become a nuisance to peel, crush, or mince garlic. Are you looking for a quick way to easily peel, press, crush, and even mince garlic? The solution is finally here with our amazing rocking garlic press! Why our garlic press is so perfect for you? Because it is so unbelievably effective! Simply press the garlic by rocking the press back and forth, and voila! You can use it to easily crush or mince multiple cloves, and make pasta sauce, garlic bread, fries, or just about anything for your whole family! The garlic easy press comes with a complimentary peeler that makes sure you can effortlessly peel multiple garlic cloves without getting any garlic smell on your table top or hands. Some of the amazing features of our garlic press: ⭐️ Multifunctional, you can use it effortlessly press, crush, or even mince garlic; ⭐️ Durable, made from the highest quality stainless steel to ensure extended durability; ⭐️ Easy to clean, clean the press by rinsing it under running water or even place it in the dishwasher; ⭐️ Comfortable, the ergonomic handle is incredibly comfortable, making it an absolute breeze to crush garlic; Easy to use, easy to clean, easy to crush!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vq6kGdtyL._AC_SL1078_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxkitchen","source_asin":"B07RK1GCPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RK1GCPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RK1GCPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
