window.products.push({"id":709509,"name":"Cedar Grove White Ceramic Kitchen Compost Bin, 1 Gallon, with Charcoal Filter Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iShcWQDsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cedar Grove 1g White Ceramic Kitchen Compost Bin Composting at home is easier with this kitchen compost pail from Cedar Grove. With its 1-gallon capacity, this countertop food waste container is the perfect place to put food scraps, egg shells, coffee grinds and more before transferring them to the compost pile, allowing easy composting at home. This attractively designed food scrap container looks great too, and has a close-fitting lid and charcoal filter keep odors at bay. If you are starting a mulch pile to make organic mulch, this countertop scrap container will help you put food waste to good use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iShcWQDsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cedar Grove","source_asin":"B011PD8296","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011PD8296","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011PD8296","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
