window.products.push({"id":709701,"name":"DKLGG Industrial Shoe Rack, 5-Tier Shoe Storage, Shoe Shelf with 4 Metal Mesh Shelves for 16 Pairs, Metal Shoe Rack Durable and Stable for Entryway, H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPE-iVCdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Industrial Shoe Rack: The moment your friends entered your entryway, they will be impressed by this attractive shoe rack which is crafted with an rustic wooden board in a sturdy metal frame. Simple and elegant industrial shoe rack better decorate your home. Strong Design: The 5-tier shoe rack organizer made of 4 open shelves steel mesh plenty and metal frame of space for your shoes. The eye-catching rustic brown top surface welcomes bags, keys, picture frames, or a pretty bouquet of roses.Mesh shoe racks give your home a unique industrial look.(top surface holds up to 44 lb, shoe shelves up to 11 lb each) A Perfect Home of Your Shoes: Gone are the days of your shoes scattered around. You can accommodate them in this simple and precise 5-tier metal shoe rack instead of piling them up in the corner, each layer can hold 3-4 pairs. Place the shoes rack against the wall in any flat space. Free standing shoe racks occupying only 2.4 square ft to give you a neat and tidy home. Mufti-scenario Use: Shoe rack for entryway can keep your home tidy and tidy at all times. Use it in your entryway, closet, dormitory, patio, living room to stay away from the mess.Closet shoe rack keep your shoes from deforming, and the utility room look cleaner. The steel mesh shoe rack keeps your shoes ventilated. EASY TO ASSEMBLY: The metal shoe rack package includes shoe rack, instructions and tools.The metal shoe rack have adjustable partition allows your shoes to be switched between flat and slat. At the same time, one layer of steel mesh can be removed to build into a 3-tier or 4-tier shoe rack to accommodate different types of shoes, even high boots storage is not a problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPE-iVCdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKLGG","source_asin":"B096Z21BTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-709701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Z21BTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Z21BTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
